            "review_title": "Review at Morty's Smashburgers",
            "review_text": "Mumof04\nSt Georges Basin, Australia333 contributions\n0\nSimply the Best Don’t Miss Out!\nAug 2026 • Couples\nHands down the best burger I have ever tasted!\nSuch a cute little venue down an alley way I love the way it was decorated and the waitress was lovely !\nMy husband and I enjoyed our classic burgers ,fries and a drink each so value for money !! \nI would have loved a glass of Australian white wine to wash down my Aussie beef Pattie though 🍾\nWritten August 21, 2026",
